# ============================================================
# 知源 KnowledgeCool · Git 忽略规则
# ============================================================

# ---------------- 工具与协作目录 ----------------
# WorkBuddy 的会话、记忆、修改备份都放在这里,不进版本库
.workbuddy/

# ---------------- 依赖 ----------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.yarn/

# ---------------- 构建产物 ----------------
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------- 环境变量与密钥(严禁提交) ----------------
# 本项目可能部署在共享机器上,任何密钥、凭证一律不入库
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
credentials.json
secrets.json

# ---------------- 日志与临时文件 ----------------
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
tmp/
temp/

# ---------------- 本地数据卷(Docker / 数据库 / 附件) ----------------
data/
volumes/
docker/volumes/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ---------------- 备份产物 ----------------
backups/
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.tar.gz

# ---------------- 编辑器与操作系统 ----------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------- 测试与覆盖率 ----------------
coverage/
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
test-results/
